  "worked_solution": "The $2\\times 2$ matrix encodes the coefficients of $x$ and $y$, and the $2\\times 1$ vector on the right gives the constants, so the system is\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}8x-4y=16 \\\\ -6x+12y=-18\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nDividing the first equation by $4$ and the second by $-6$ gives the simplified system\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}2x-y=4 \\\\ x-2y=3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich matches the entries shown above.",
